      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "We need to communicate a minor, proactive delay that is already being resolved. Draft something like, \"The shipment is progressing smoothly through customs, with a minor administrative review currently underway at the port.\" Then, add, \"Our logistics team is actively managing this, and we are fully confident the delivery will arrive on Monday as scheduled.\" This frames the issue as a routine bureaucratic hurdle that you are already expertly handling.",
